   "source": [
    "## Introduction\n",
    "\n",
    "This project analyzes historical stock data for Apple Inc. from 2018 to 2025.\n",
    "The objective is to explore common challenges in financial time series modeling and demonstrate how they affect analysis and decision-making.\n",
    "\n",
    "Real-world financial data is often imperfect, and understanding these challenges is essential for building reliable models."
   ],
   "id": "b534080b9df1d353"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-05-05T10:55:29.680199500Z",
