   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": "Log returns typically reduce skewness, making the data more symmetric and suitable for modeling.",
   "id": "c8b10ca5ae2b3059"
  },
  {
   "metadata": {},
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": "## Challenge 3: Overfitting\n",
